# Component: TodoApi
## Description: REST controller component exposing todo item CRUD over HTTP
## Dependencies: TodoService
## Namespace: MyApp.Api.Controllers
## Version: 1.0.0

### Requirements
- REQ-1: Route HTTP requests to the todo service without exposing domain entities
- Must respond with ProblemDetails on invalid input
- Should validate routes before delegating to the service

### API Endpoints
- GET /api/todos: list all todo items
- POST /api/todos: create a new todo item
- PUT /api/todos/{id}: update an existing todo item
- DELETE /api/todos/{id}: delete a todo item

### Data Model
- TodoDto
  - Id: Guid
  - Title: string
  - IsCompleted: bool

### Compliance
- complies-with ADR-0015
- satisfies M-002
